# VKARD.AZ — Project Instance

Purpose:
  Concrete project instance for vkard.az. Contains all project state:
  decisions, tasks, docs, stack, testing, context, cases, bugs,
  dependencies, observability, workflow, architecture, and tokens.
  Also contains AI representation of the real project codebase
  for semantic navigation and feature planning.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @MAP.md
   3 @STRUCTURE.md
   4 @decisions/INDEX.sdd
   5 @tasks/INDEX.sdd
   6 @docs/INDEX.sdd
   7 @stack/INDEX.sdd
   8 @context/INDEX.sdd
   9 @cases/INDEX.sdd
   10 @bugs/INDEX.sdd
   11 @dependencies/INDEX.sdd
   12 @gates/INDEX.sdd
   13 @observability/INDEX.sdd
   14 @workflow/INDEX.sdd
   15 @architecture/INDEX.sdd
   16 @testing/INDEX.sdd
   17 @tokens/

Rules:
  [V1] All project state MUST live under this directory.
  [V2] Decisions MUST be tracked in decisions/.
  [V3] Tasks MUST be tracked in tasks/.
  [V4] Documentation MUST live in docs/.
  [V5] Stack declarations MUST live in stack/.
  [V6] Context MUST be managed in context/.
  [V7] Cases and bugs MUST be tracked in cases/ and bugs/.
  [V8] Dependencies MUST be declared in dependencies/.
  [V9] Gates MUST be enforced via gates/.
  [V10] Observability data MUST live in observability/.
  [V11] Workflow state MUST live in workflow/.
  [V12] Architecture decisions MUST live in architecture/.
  [V13] Test results MUST live in testing/.
  [V14] Token records MUST live in tokens/.
  [V15] MAP.md MUST contain real project location and file mappings.
  [V16] STRUCTURE.md MUST describe the real codebase structure.
  [V17] Feature decisions MUST use MAP.md and STRUCTURE.md for context.

Navigation:
  Model: @../project/INDEX.sdd
  Registry: @../INDEX.sdd
  Map: @MAP.md
  Structure: @STRUCTURE.md
